WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.757
Unit four. Bullying Prevention and Kindness!

2
00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:08.389
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.439 --> 00:00:11.861
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:16.333
Today we learn about Bullying Prevention and Kindness. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.008 --> 00:00:20.442
Bullying. Say it with me. Bullying!

6
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:27.603
Bystander. Say it with me. Bystander!

7
00:00:31.076 --> 00:00:34.976
Upstander. Say it with me. Upstander!

8
00:00:38.473 --> 00:00:42.323
Empathy. Say it with me. Empathy!

9
00:00:45.838 --> 00:00:49.222
Report. Say it with me. Report!

10
00:00:52.705 --> 00:00:56.672
Inclusion. Say it with me. Inclusion!

11
00:01:00.182 --> 00:01:03.749
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

12
00:01:07.242 --> 00:01:12.209
Conflict resolution. Say it with me. Conflict resolution!

13
00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:28.871
Bullying can hurt anyone, but a bystander can become an upstander by showing empathy. It is important to report bullying and support inclusion and respect. Learning conflict resolution helps prevent problems.

14
00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.258
I can do that too!

15
00:01:31.792 --> 00:01:36.853
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.903 --> 00:01:38.053
Upstander!

17
00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:44.431
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.481 --> 00:01:45.631
Respect!

19
00:01:46.549 --> 00:01:54.479
Did you know? Research found that when classmates step in, bullying stops within about 10 seconds more than half of the time!

20
00:01:54.529 --> 00:01:56.383
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:57.081 --> 00:02:04.927
Think and answer. What can you do if you see someone being bullied?

22
00:02:04.977 --> 00:02:06.127
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.221 --> 00:02:12.127
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:12.177 --> 00:02:14.925
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

